Package: librsvg2-common
Version: @DEB_LIBRSVG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/LibRsvg
Depends: librsvg2-2 (= @DEB_LIBRSVG_V@), libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libglib2.0-0
Description: SVG loader for GdkPixbuf
 This package contains the GdkPixbuf loader module that lets GTK and GNOME
 applications load SVG images transparently through the normal icon-theme and
 pixbuf APIs.
